  "summary": "A kidnapping case has been reported in Ludhiana, Punjab, where a local political figure is allegedly involved in the abduction of a young girl. The incident reportedly occurred after the victim's brother filed a complaint against the accused. Law enforcement has been criticized for their apparent lack of action in the case.",
  "content": "A concerning kidnapping case has emerged in Ludhiana, where a local political figure has allegedly abducted a young girl in what appears to be an act of retaliation. According to reports, the kidnapping occurred after the victim's brother had filed a complaint against the accused.\n\nLocal residents have expressed outrage over the apparent inaction by law enforcement authorities in addressing the situation. The accused is reportedly making public statements about the kidnapping, adding to the community's concerns about public safety and abuse of power.\n\nThe police's delayed response to the incident has sparked criticism from local community members and activists calling for immediate intervention.",
